<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 15:40:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>银行为 CVC 可能收购 Verisure 提供 110 亿欧元债务</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/banks-pitch-cvc-11-billion-debt-for-possible-verisure-takeover</link><description>银行正在向 CVC Capital Partners Plc 提供高达 110 亿欧元（合 120 亿美元）的债务融资，用于收购 Verisure Plc，因为这家收购公司在经历了公开市场艰难的一年后，正在考虑将家庭安全集团重新归私人所有。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/banks-pitch-cvc-11-billion-debt-for-possible-verisure-takeover'&gt;银行为 CVC 可能收购 Verisure 提供 110 亿欧元债务&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Banks Pitch CVC €11 Billion Debt for Possible Verisure Takeover&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/banks-pitch-cvc-11-billion-debt-for-possible-verisure-takeover</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 15:07:25 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>量化基金很难跟上股票波动的步伐</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/quant-funds-are-having-a-hard-time-keeping-up-with-this-market</link><description>股市的叙事变化如此之快，即使是所谓的快钱也跟不上。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/quant-funds-are-having-a-hard-time-keeping-up-with-this-market'&gt;量化基金很难跟上股票波动的步伐&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Quant Funds Are Having a Hard Time Keeping Up With Stock Swings&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/quant-funds-are-having-a-hard-time-keeping-up-with-this-market</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 21:36:22 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>印度航空首席执行官寻求今年削减 6.5 亿美元成本</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/air-india-chief-seeks-to-cut-650-million-in-costs-this-year</link><description>据知情人士透露，印度航空有限公司希望本财年削减 600 亿卢比（6.5 亿美元）的成本，其新任首席执行官概述了振兴塔塔集团旗下航空公司的举措，该航空公司在截至 3 月份的财年中出现了创纪录的亏损。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/air-india-chief-seeks-to-cut-650-million-in-costs-this-year'&gt;印度航空首席执行官寻求今年削减 6.5 亿美元成本&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Air India Chief Seeks to Cut $650 Million in Costs This Year&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/air-india-chief-seeks-to-cut-650-million-in-costs-this-year</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 15:20:13 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>由于挥之不去的人工智能担忧，美国科技股将继续下跌</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/us-stock-index-futures-slide-as-ai-worries-fuel-tech-losses</link><description>由于投资者担心人工智能建设的巨额投资的回报，美国科技股预计将连续第二天下跌。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/us-stock-index-futures-slide-as-ai-worries-fuel-tech-losses'&gt;由于挥之不去的人工智能担忧，美国科技股将继续下跌&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Nasdaq 100 Slumps in ‘Sell First’ Mode as AI Angst Fuels Losses&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/us-stock-index-futures-slide-as-ai-worries-fuel-tech-losses</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 07:51:43 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>双线资本 (DoubleLine) 的科恩 (Cohen) 在遭遇 AI 债务抛售后，从憎恨者转变为热爱人工智能债务的人</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/doubleline-s-cohen-turns-ai-debt-lover-from-hater-after-selloff</link><description>人工智能债务已经变得足够便宜，足以吸引双线资本的罗伯特·科恩，他曾警告该行业可能存在泡沫。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/doubleline-s-cohen-turns-ai-debt-lover-from-hater-after-selloff'&gt;双线资本 (DoubleLine) 的科恩 (Cohen) 在遭遇 AI 债务抛售后，从憎恨者转变为热爱人工智能债务的人&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：DoubleLine’s Cohen Turns AI Debt Lover From Hater After Selloff&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/doubleline-s-cohen-turns-ai-debt-lover-from-hater-after-selloff</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 15:27:51 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>